  "note": "New subpath ./purchase/evidence-recorder with createPurchaseEvidenceRecorder({admission, journal}). It records what a wallet reported after a handoff (hash, nonce, state) under purchase-evidence/<deliveryId>, at most eight distinct reports per delivery, appended under the delivery's lane lock and never overwritten, and reads back the retained CREATE records for a delivery. It runs no binding check, hold or stop check, clears no suspension and can cause no signature, send or wallet request. public-admission.mjs exports readAdmission unchanged; the manifest pin in scripts/check-hold.mjs gains the new export."
